<title>Uploading</title></sect2></sect1>
<sect1 id="uploading_1autotoc_md99_1s1"><sect2 id="uploading_1autotoc_md99">
<title>Uploading from within the Editor</title><para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Make and Upload your project:</para>
<para>By clicking the PROS Quick Action button the editor will make and upload your project.</para>
<para>.. image:: /images/atom/quick-action.png</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
</sect2></sect1>
<sect1 id="uploading_1autotoc_md100_1s1"><sect2 id="uploading_1autotoc_md100">
<title>Uploading through the PROS CLI</title><para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Running <computeroutput>pros upload</computeroutput> on the command line will upload your project to the V5 brain.</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
</sect2></sect1>
<sect1 id="uploading_1autotoc_md101_1s1"><sect2 id="uploading_1autotoc_md101">
<title>Wireless Upload</title><para>To see more details on how to wireless upload see <ref refid="wireless-upload" kindref="compound">Wireless Upload and Hot/Cold Linking</ref> </para>
</sect2></sect1>
